  "question": {
    "text": "If for a plane, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>z</mi></math> intercepts are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;respectively, then the length of the perpendicular from the origin on to the plane is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;units",
